WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:25.000
Download Ghostline installer or portable zip and verify SHA256 integrity.

2
00:00:25.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Install to LocalAppData. For SmartScreen, select More Info and Run Anyway.

3
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:35.000
Configure your AI: choose local Ollama for full privacy or cloud BYOK.

4
00:01:35.000 --> 00:02:00.000
Fill out your candidate profile so Ghostline can answer on your behalf.

5
00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:20.000
Ghostline sits quietly in your system tray. Press Alt + / to begin.
